Leak to a place like no others.
But even the merger of the real estate company with the U.S
Donald Trump had to lower the price of his Caribbean mansion by a whopping 8 million pounds.
The original price of the property was 21.5 million pounds, the final price fell to 13 million pounds.
Even after the discount, therefore, the villa complex stands like 76 average apartments in the center of Prague.
And it's no wonder.
